+in #6903 already handles arbitrary fixed N, but its actual numerical join is
+explicitly N=64. The existing #2835/#6896 capacity theorems also pin that old
+dimension. A generic claim that preparation is finite-dimensional does not
+supply the matching encoded consumer or its retained physical roles.
+
+## Exact contribution
+
+This package authenticates and specializes the four retained encoded
+Callback/Fields/Matrices/words modules with 17 explicit edits for each fixed
+N≥2. Runtime values remain binary words; all N² high digits and original
+global source labels are preserved. One Workspace supplies the same four
+continuation tapes on each closed reentry.
+
+The written proof establishes exact Good/Pair/Unit and coefficient semantics,
+pending demand of at most `16N²+128` residue and `128` index Words over **all**
+entry residents before the first capacity guard, and explicit full-prefix and
+separate historical-tape bounds. Every admitted descriptor contracts by at
